From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Radical <radical@radical.fun>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 19:52:15 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] firmware: qcom: scm: Allow QSEECOM on AYANEO Pocket DS

Allow the AYANEO Pocket DS to access the UEFI variables through the
uefisecapp QSEECOM application, e.g. for efivarfs.

Signed-off-by: Radical <radical@radical.fun>
---
 drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c b/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c
index 26bf872..c1578f3 100644
--- a/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c
+++ b/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c
@@ -2291,6 +2291,7 @@ static const struct of_device_id qcom_scm_qseecom_allowlist[] __maybe_unused = {
 	{ .compatible = "asus,vivobook-s15-x1p4" },
 	{ .compatible = "asus,zenbook-a14-ux3407qa" },
 	{ .compatible = "asus,zenbook-a14-ux3407ra" },
+	{ .compatible = "ayaneo,pocketds" },
 	{ .compatible = "dell,inspiron-14-plus-7441" },
 	{ .compatible = "dell,latitude-7455" },
 	{ .compatible = "dell,xps13-9345" },
-- 
2.55.0

